# HTTP Observatory

GitHub Pages cannot emit custom security headers (`_headers` / `.htaccess` are ignored). Observatory therefore scores this app about **B / 75** (XFO −20, XCTO −5). That grade is **accepted** here.

Do not chase A+ via Cloudflare or other proxies unless Dave asks. Keep the in-page meta CSP tight (no `'unsafe-inline'` / `'unsafe-eval'`, explicit `connect-src`). Keep the Observatory PDF in the repo when a new scan is dropped in.
